@startuml
title MiniDB Benchmark - Vista Architetturale

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "Specifica comune" {
  artifact "spec/commands.md" as Spec
}

package "Implementazioni MiniDB" {
  component "Java MiniDB" as JavaMiniDb {
    [Main]
    [Command]
    [MiniDb]
    [Response]
  }

  component "Python MiniDB" as PythonMiniDb {
    [main.py]
    [command.py]
    [db.py]
    [response.py]
  }

  component "Rust MiniDB" as RustMiniDb {
    [main.rs]
    [command.rs]
    [db.rs]
    [response.rs]
  }
}

package "Benchmark" {
  component "BenchmarkRunner" as BenchmarkRunner
  folder "benchmark/workloads" as Workloads
  database "benchmark/results" as Results
}

Spec ..> JavaMiniDb : definisce comportamento
Spec ..> PythonMiniDb : definisce comportamento
Spec ..> RustMiniDb : definisce comportamento

BenchmarkRunner --> Workloads : legge comandi
BenchmarkRunner --> JavaMiniDb : avvia processo
BenchmarkRunner --> PythonMiniDb : avvia processo
BenchmarkRunner --> RustMiniDb : avvia processo
BenchmarkRunner --> Results : scrive CSV e riepiloghi

note right of Spec
Comandi supportati:
PING, SET, GET, DEL,
EXISTS, INCR, EXPIRE, TTL.
end note

note bottom of BenchmarkRunner
Misura throughput, latenza e memoria
su workload confrontabili.
end note

@enduml
